<title>HONG KONG: Concord Land announces 1st final results.</title>
<headline>Concord Land announces 1st final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    55.73</p>
<p>    Turnover		     165.91</p>
<p>    Company name		 Concord Land Development Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 23-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 9</p>
<p>NOTE - Property developer Concord Land, a subsidiary of Pacific Concord Holding Ltd, was listed on the Hong Kong stock exchange on November 7, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
